ul.li:
↑ Import Project creates a new project from either of two files:


a JSON file produced by the wizard's JSON data format, which restores the project in full (attachment files aside);

a ReqIF file (.reqif or .xml), from OpenV or from another requirements tool, which brings the hierarchy, links, statuses and attributes. Attachments and embedded objects are not carried, and a file from another tool is read on a best-effort basis, so check the new project against the source before relying on it.
